# Studio probe: a loop's end flows into its start. Nothing plays in the
# first two beats; a long-reverb chord at the end of the loop rings across
# the seam, so the rendered loop starts inside that tail. Sines: no
# waveform edges, so any step at the seam is the seam.
score 1
tempo 0 120
length 8
loop on
aux long reverb preset=long
inst pad synth send=long:0 wave=sine stack=3 detune=10 attack=0.05 decay=0.2 sustain=0.8 release=0.3
note 6 1.5 pad E3 110
note 6 1.5 pad B3 110
note 6 1.5 pad G4 110
